KEY: consec MAXIMIZES q0. It has the HIGHEST even AND highest odd Bonferroni, but its even advantage
EXCEEDS its odd advantage:  Delta_even(consec vs E2)=0.148 > Delta_odd=0.134  => Delta_q0=+0.014>0.
=> THE NODE INEQUALITY: q0(consec)>=q0(E)  <=>  Delta_even >= Delta_odd.
   EVEN Bonferroni = SOS/Bochner-positive (mac-mini S75e even half = the Fejer cyclotomic square).
   ODD Bonferroni  = the obstruction = (trace SIGN) x (SOS magnitude) (Brouwer, HYP-3219).
   CERTIFICATE STRUCTURE: the SOS even advantage dominates the sign-controlled odd advantage.
